"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "刘海顶行最左边的 + 会在你选择的文件夹中开始一个标签页：你的登录 Shell 会进入该文件夹，然后运行命令，所以你的 PATH 和智能体自己的登录都会生效。每个标签页都是仪表板上的一个小组件，打开后会变成它的终端，并且在刘海合上时仍会继续运行。Scout 重新启动后，标签页会自己回来，各自回到自己的文件夹，智能体会用恢复命令继续；关闭该选项时，它们会改为在 + › 继续 下等待。";
